Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.90,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,When I was in grade school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.98,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I was a gloomy, sullen, unpleasant child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:14.20,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,And because of that, \NI didn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.07,flashback,Misaki's Mom,0,0,0,,Ko-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:21.37,flashback,Misaki's Mom,0,0,0,,Your cousin, Carol-chan, \Nis here to play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.54,flashback,Misaki's Mom,0,0,0,,She's as pretty as a little angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:28.13,flashback,Misaki,0,0,0,,Adults are always so quick to \Ndescribe little kids as "angels."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:31.01,flashback,Misaki's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh, honey, do you have to be like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.06,flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:51.73,flashback italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:00:54.65,flashback italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,an actual angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:16.05,italics,OP,0,0,0,,When I throw a jab or a straight,\N it always lands
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:21.18,italics,OP,0,0,0,,But when I'm aiming for your heart,\N I miss every time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:26.52,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:31.02,italics,OP,0,0,0,,When you look my way and move closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:36.78,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:41.83,italics,OP,0,0,0,,But I wish we could stay like this forever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:47.96,italics,OP,0,0,0,,My changing feelings are driving me crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:53.25,italics,OP,0,0,0,,The moment you turn to face me,\N take that! Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:58.72,italics,OP,0,0,0,,If only we could feel the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:03.60,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to kick this pesky subtlety away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:09.60,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to know everything, \NI want to know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:12.15,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I can't fool you forever
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:14.78,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I can't keep this hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:19.53,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to shout out my secret, AHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:23.99,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Take that! Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:26.45,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Te-te-te-telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:29.54,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:35.00,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(515,1)\pos(318,115)\fsp2}The Angel{\3c&H5A5659&\c&HEBEBEB&}'s
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:35.00,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(320,225)\fad(515,1)\fscx85}True Face
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.63,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"The Angel's True Face."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:37.76,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I-It's good to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:40.55,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm Misaki Kosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:44.35,main,Goro,0,0,0,,I admire your resolve to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.14,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:49.14,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,He said he wanted to join the dojo, \Nbut I didn't think he really would.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:51.65,main,Goro,0,0,0,,But you are clearly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.23,main,Goro,0,0,0,,weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.57,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,You think so, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.53,main,Goro,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:01.16,main,Goro,0,0,0,,I see something more behind the weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:03.53,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:09.62,main,Goro,0,0,0,,There's an evil spirit lurking in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:12.21,main,Goro,0,0,0,,You had best be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:14.08,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.79,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,That's my dad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Senpai, we'll start with running!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.13,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Osu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:28.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,We're only going up and \Ndown 200 little steps!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:33.56,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Next is strength training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.11,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Three sets of fifty push-ups!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:38.32,main,Goro,0,0,0,,You haven't pushed up once yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.32,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Senpai, you'll be having a match next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:43.57,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,R-Right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:47.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"Train in extremes" is \Nour motto at this dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:51.75,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Your opponent isn't gonna care \Nwhat kind of condition you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:53.58,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Your first opponent...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.50,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,will be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.63,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,My first battle with Jun-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:03.01,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I want him to face me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:08.60,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,If I can beat you in this fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:16.11,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Do you think Aizawa-san will \Nactually acknowledge me a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:19.90,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:26.41,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,This is Jun-kun's real strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.58,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,He said Aizawa-san was stronger than him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:31.20,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,but there's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:33.29,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,He's overwhelming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.75,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun looks like he's having a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:43.22,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Nothing like when he's up against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.85,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Don't swing your arm out so wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:56.81,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,And don't think you can get by \Non just the heat of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:05:01.44,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,If you want someone stronger \Nto acknowledge you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:04.99,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,you gotta cough up the effort, layer upon \Nbloody layer, until you surpass them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:08.07,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.87,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I know I can't win,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.37,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,but if I can at least get one hit in...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:24.55,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:37.60,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:39.48,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,In my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:41.36,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What about practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:43.15,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:44.23,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:47.36,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun really doesn't know how to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.99,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I really am pathetic, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:51.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:57.33,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Also... were you hoping to get \Nstronger for Carol's sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:58.33,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:00.63,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Well, th-that's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.79,0:06:02.71,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:05.26,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,That's right, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:06.76,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,So I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:10.14,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Given the way she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:14.01,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,she's gotten herself into trouble a \Nton of times since we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:18.48,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to get \Nstronger for her sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:22.69,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But I've never been able \Nto do anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:24.32,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Like this last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:30.86,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:34.91,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I told you, Senpai, you're not pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:38.04,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Just because someone's better \Nthan you at one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:41.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,doesn't make it right to reject \Neverything about yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:43.67,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You said that yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:48.26,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Besides, no matter how much \Nyou train up your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,the things you can resolve with this \Nare things that don't even matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:53.39,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,There are different kinds of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:06.28,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Ko-chan, you've seemed a \Nlittle more manly lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:08.15,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:08.82,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:13.12,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I've actually been going to \NAizawa-san's family dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.16,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:16.83,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Aizawa-san's dad is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.00,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Of course, that also makes \Nhis practices tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:24.21,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But I want to become the kind \Nof man that she'll acknowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:27.25,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Ko-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:30.55,main,Carol,0,0,0,,How do you feel about Tomo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:33.05,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do you ask that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:34.47,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:38.35,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I see Aizawa-san as... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:39.93,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,a role model, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:43.31,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,It's obvious that she's physically strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:45.31,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,but she's more than just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.36,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,She's someone I want to catch up to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:50.65,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,and be good enough to \Nstand alongside someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.57,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:59.29,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Jun-kun, Jun-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:02.96,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Want to hang out with me after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:03.83,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.80,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I don't particularly want \Nto hang out with you, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:10.01,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I don't either, particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:11.63,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Then why'd you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:17.30,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I heard you asking Junichiro \Nto hang out with you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:19.31,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:20.60,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh, you saw that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:23.39,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:25.15,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,but all of your meddling—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:26.31,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Hey, Misuzu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.31,0:08:30.19,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Do you still think everything's \Ngoing to go your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:37.49,main,Kid1,0,0,0,,All right! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:39.24,main,Kid2,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:44.42,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why did you want to come to the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:46.29,main,Carol,0,0,0,,To watch people playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:49.38,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why would you just watch other people play?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.42,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Go play with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.76,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo and Gundo would join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:56.64,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I don't think things will\N work like that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.76,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:02.89,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I said something really mean to \NMisuzu-chan at school today,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:05.27,main,Carol,0,0,0,,and I'm doing something mean to Tomo now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:07.06,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.98,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Don't take Tomo for a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:13.19,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:17.41,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,but Tomo's not the type to give \Nup on a friend just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:23.12,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. You've got me for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.96,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You'll play with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:27.58,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Only a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:33.13,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.72,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why did {\i0}this{\i1} happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:37.63,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is your room, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.64,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Just leave now. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:41.51,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:46.64,main,Carol,0,0,0,,See, the thing is, there's someone I like,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:49.19,main,Carol,0,0,0,,but it's just not panning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:51.90,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What does that have to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:55.82,main,Carol,0,0,0,,If it doesn't work out, \Nit's partially your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:58.49,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What? My fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:09:59.20,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:02.12,main,Carol,0,0,0,,So I came here to take out \Nmy frustrations on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:05.29,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I'm gonna torture you \Na little. Don't cry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.79,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:07.92,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.46,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:11.21,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Go home once you get bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.00,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Mwah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:14.38,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell did you—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:14.96,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Slam!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.93,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Rawr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:27.06,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sh-She's scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.44,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:33.57,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:36.99,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Why are you so afraid of girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:40.36,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You react like that to \NTomo-chan, too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.33,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Poor Tomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:47.58,main,Carol,0,0,0,,If you keep that up, you won't \Nget to be with her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:02.05,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun? Weren't you hanging \Nout with Carol today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:05.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,J-Jun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:06.93,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:13.65,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I just kinda... got hit with \Nan attack I wasn't expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:18.40,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What the heck did this to \Na guy as tough as you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.28,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That blonde chick was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:28.79,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,But I still can't fully \Naccept that Tomo is a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:29.96,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,And I bet it's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:34.34,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,We still haven't settled \Nthat man-to-man score yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.21,0:11:36.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:38.92,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'll help if you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:39.67,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.97,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,It's not something that you can help with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.72,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I mean, we're talking about that—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:45.80,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.98,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Jun-kun, Tomo-chan, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:53.52,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh? O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:04.49,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about yesterday, Misuzu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:05.53,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:09.04,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But how did Senpai react to the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.50,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:13.33,flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,I hung out with Jun-kun yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:14.63,flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:15.46,flashback,Misaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:19.84,flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,We went to the park, and then \Nwe hung out in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.22,flashback,Misaki,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.89,flashback,Misaki,0,0,0,,Did you have a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:28.56,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Ko-chan made a really weird face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.02,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're a frightening woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:33.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,There's no telling what you'd \Ndo if left to your own devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:35.85,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just get you \Ntogether with Senpai already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:37.69,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.82,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Misuzu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.23,0:12:43.45,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I feel like she's going to \Nbe the bigger problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:49.58,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Carol, have you ever let Senpai \Nsee you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:12:58.59,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Gundo-san, what did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:02.26,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,How do you feel about Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:03.05,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:07.43,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,H-How do I... I mean, \Nshe's like a little sister to—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:07.89,top,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You can drop that front now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:10.89,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You love her, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.89,0:13:17.35,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,That's right. I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:18.81,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:22.11,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Your murderous rampage at the \Nfactory made that obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:23.11,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:28.03,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,And you know how she feels, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:30.78,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Why won't you give her the answer she wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.24,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,B-Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:37.96,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Carol is really strong, unlike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:42.96,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I've known her forever, but I've \Nnever seen her in a weak state.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:47.05,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I thought I was drawn to her strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:50.30,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,but once I started thinking about \Nhaving that kind of relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:51.93,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I suddenly felt scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.47,0:13:55.06,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,That whether I said something \Nto try to woo her
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.44,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,or pushed her away as coldly as I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:14:00.65,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,she'd just accept it like it \Nwas the most natural thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:03.98,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,It's not that I want her to be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:05.78,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I don't, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:08.11,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,He does have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.61,0:14:11.45,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Basically, no matter how much time goes by,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:14.20,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,she's just so dazzling that \NI can't look straight at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:17.08,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I really am a sad excuse \Nfor a man, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:20.79,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What do you think of couples who keep saying
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.79,0:14:23.46,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,that they're going to \Nbreak up, but never do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:25.71,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't think it's very—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.01,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:28.43,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You wish they'd just disappear, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:29.93,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:34.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But I think a little bargaining \Nis necessary sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.64,0:14:37.23,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,She seems to do it on occasion herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.69,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What? Carol wouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.40,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,She would, and she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:45.82,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're probably too nice \Nto pull it off, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:47.40,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,so would you like me to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.36,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:52.87,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You want to see her in a \Nvulnerable state, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:55.91,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What? When did we get to that point?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:01.71,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Misuzu-chan, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:04.50,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You went to talk to Ko-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.67,main,Carol,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:09.05,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's going to hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:11.14,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I didn't expect this to weigh on me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:15.01,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But this is the only chance I'll \Nhave to expose her real face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:18.23,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Frankly, I don't think you have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:20.85,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:22.56,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You mean—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.44,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You get it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:27.82,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You know he doesn't even \Nthink of you as a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:32.20,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I know you used Junichiro \Nto try to shake him up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:36.58,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,but he probably just felt like a father \Ngiving his daughter away to her groom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.62,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I doubt that will even upset her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.25,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Please be at least a little upset...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:43.50,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:47.34,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,So when they do that, you do this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:49.88,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,No, no! You gotta start up higher—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:53.59,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, Carol! It's dangerous \Nto run in the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:00.85,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Misaki-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:05.94,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Gundo-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:11.49,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I told her she doesn't \Nhave a chance with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.45,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:16.37,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I didn't think it \Nwould affect her {\i1}that{\i0} much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:19.33,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! \NWhat happened to Carol?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:23.25,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You need to go to her house right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:26.75,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You should at least... at the very least...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:30.09,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,see what she looks like right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:43.27,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Did Carol go home early because \Nof something you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:44.14,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Tomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:47.52,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Yes. It's because I was mean to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:48.86,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:52.78,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You can drop the bad girl act. \NJust explain what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:54.82,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one out of the loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.37,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're not even going to admonish me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:00.62,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hah. Don't take me too lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:10.05,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Um... I heard Carol came \Nhome from school early...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:18.47,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,We'll call this one a draw \Ndue to injury, Kosuke-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:19.68,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:25.81,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:31.48,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,She thinks I indirectly rejected her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:37.20,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,So will she still greet me with \Na smile like she always does?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:38.28,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.33,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Caro—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:52.00,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm an absolute monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:18:00.97,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I couldn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:04.02,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,No... I never tried to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:07.44,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,She's not an angel, and she's not a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:11.40,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,She's just a girl who gets lonely easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.19,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Caro—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:19.57,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You jerk! Jerk! Why did you \Ncome here?! Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:23.20,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Carol! Listen to me! \NWhat Gundo-san said was a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:25.50,main,Carol,0,0,0,,It was?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.50,0:18:30.04,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Yes, it was! She said it to try to \Nget you in a vulnerable state!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:32.67,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:35.84,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Gundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:40.34,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Misuzu-chan! That jerk! What's her deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:42.81,top,Misaki,0,0,0,,It's not like that! I think \Nshe was trying to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:48.48,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Why would Misuzu-chan being \Nmean to me help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:49.06,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.69,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Er... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.07,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:54.48,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:58.40,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Gundo-san made Carol \Nhate her instead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:01.32,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,And look at how much of herself \NCarol is showing to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:05.87,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I guess there's no way to run back \Nto being a coward at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:11.96,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Gundo-san was trying to give me a push,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:14.25,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,so I could tell you how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.88,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I love you, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.89,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Sorry it took me so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:32.40,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Banzai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:37.44,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You know what? You know what? \NI love you too, Ko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.28,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Thanks! That makes me happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:43.74,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What was it that made you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:47.12,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Um... I never thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:48.08,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,You didn't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:52.83,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I mean, you've always been by my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:55.13,main,Carol,0,0,0,,and you've always been kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.13,0:19:59.67,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I don't know when or why \Nit happened anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:02.68,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I love you because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:06.72,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:08.68,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Wait, Carol! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:13.85,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,That'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:15.64,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:22.32,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,The reason Carol-chan never stops smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:26.95,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,is because I told her that she \Nlooks cuter when she smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:27.91,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:32.87,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,I said it when she was little to make \Nher feel better because she was crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:34.38,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,but she said...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:37.04,flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:40.67,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,And from then on, she wouldn't cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.59,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,I'm scared for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:47.18,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,As it is, they say love changes a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:49.85,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,but if you said anything like \Nthat to her as her boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:52.85,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,there's no telling how it might change her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:54.85,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,It just worries me so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:58.86,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Well, I don't have any intention \Nof saying anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.86,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:05.49,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Carol has other important people in her \Nlife now besides me and her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:06.99,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,She has friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:11.75,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I think she knows what it means \Nto be loved by those around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:15.83,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,She wouldn't change just \Nbecause of something I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:21.21,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,That made me trust you a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:22.92,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,About this much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:26.68,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Looks like I've got a long road ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:29.93,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Carol's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:32.83,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Is she not coming to school today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:34.29,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I wouldn't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.29,0:21:37.52,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,After what happened yesterday, \Neven she must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.87,0:21:45.53,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Misuzu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.82,0:21:46.62,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:49.07,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,She's mad! You gotta apologize, Misuzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:52.29,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Mwah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:54.68,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:01.24,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You lost this one, Misuzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:02.62,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.01,0:22:04.47,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I have not lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.33,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:14.60,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(This suspicious behavior is...)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:18.90,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:23.36,italics,ED,0,0,0,,It's too complicated, I'm freaking out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:25.90,italics,ED,0,0,0,,I want to look cute to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.69,0:22:29.24,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:28.53,italics,ED,0,0,0,,So I'm plotting, bargaining, \Nsly, and stubborn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:33.04,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Dizzying love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.20,0:22:38.62,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Just tell him to look at you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:43.59,italics,ED,0,0,0,,And watch him stiffen up even more, \Nbecause you're both so awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:47.47,italics,ED,0,0,0,,What? Even if we're alike in that way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:52.05,italics,ED,0,0,0,,It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it\N means our love is going nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.05,0:23:00.94,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—\NI sense rain coming
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:10.03,italics,ED,0,0,0,,So I partly open my umbrella, \Nthen sneakily scoot closer to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.03,0:23:13.99,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Please notice the curl of my \Neyelashes as I keep blinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.99,0:23:18.91,italics,ED,0,0,0,,And don't say I'm acting weird
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:22.88,italics,ED,0,0,0,,All this plotting and bargaining \Nis my sly plan to look cute to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.88,0:23:27.92,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Try to solve the riddle of \Nthis soft, dizzying love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:30.05,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(Buzzing, fidgeting)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:34.85,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Listen, I might be a bit \Ntangled in my own web now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.85,0:23:38.89,italics,ED,0,0,0,,But once you unravel the mystery, \Nyou'll see pure lo-love
